---
source: crates/gt-jam/src/text.rs
expression: wording
---
label: Aircraft interference
summary: Share of aircraft over this area that reported low navigation accuracy, over one UTC day.
source caveat: Reported by aircraft in flight, not measured on the ground - a track under an affected cell is not necessarily affected, and a clear cell is not a guarantee.
resolution caveat: One cell spans roughly 22 km and one value covers a full 24-hour UTC day, so neither the minute nor the kilometer of an event can be read from this.
low sample caveat: Too few aircraft passed through this cell for the share to carry weight.
fetch queue hover: Interference days waiting to be downloaded. One day is requested at a time, and one day costs one request.
recording day coverage hover: UTC days the recordings loaded this session span, and how many of them the archive holds a dataset for. Days downloaded by a backfill are not counted here.
plot hover: Share of aircraft that reported low navigation accuracy, one value per archived UTC day across the span the plot shows, over the cell the receiver was in nearest that day in time. Reported by aircraft in flight, not measured on the ground - a track under an affected cell is not necessarily affected, and a clear cell is not a guarantee. One cell spans roughly 22 km and one value covers a full 24-hour UTC day, so neither the minute nor the kilometer of an event can be read from this. The line breaks over days that are not archived.
query doc: Share of aircraft over the fix's cell that reported low navigation accuracy, in percent, for the fix's own UTC day. Reported by aircraft in flight, not measured on the ground - a track under an affected cell is not necessarily affected, and a clear cell is not a guarantee. One cell spans roughly 22 km and one value covers a full 24-hour UTC day, so neither the minute nor the kilometer of an event can be read from this. Fixes whose day is not in the interference archive carry no value.
attribution: Interference data from gpsjam.org, derived from aircraft reports collected by adsbexchange.com.
publisher: https://gpsjam.org
upstream: https://adsbexchange.com
